#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:3
#: ee1618578b5a4dfeb9a4975f10c70314
msgid ""
"This section documents ros2_control **hardware interfaces** — plugins "
"that talk to the bus, vendor SDK, or simulation. Chinese **驱动层** is this "
"same layer."
msgstr "本节记录 ros2_control **驱动层** — 对接总线、厂商 SDK 或仿真的插件。中文 **驱动层** 就是这一层。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:5
#: 95ad2cd1e35f4567aee45451e7d0e5a0
msgid ""
"Public plugins live under [arms_ros2_control "
"`hardwares/`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/.gitmodules) (plus in-tree "
"`topic_based_ros2_control`). Use the plugin class from that robot’s "
"`xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro`. Each public driver page has the intro "
"(plugin class, repo) and its `<param>` tables."
msgstr ""
"公开插件在 [arms_ros2_control `hardwares/`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/.gitmodules) 下（另有树内 "
"`topic_based_ros2_control`）。插件类以该机型 `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` "
"为准。每个公开驱动页含简介（插件类、仓库）及其 `<param>` 表。"

