#: 5cc402a7e74a43b8a72b10b141f743ce
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "依据"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: 726891c884ec403a8236f7a2adc71b26
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: cb3428733d60484f824bb6a64409a587
msgid ""
"Read in `on_init` from `info_.hardware_parameters`. No "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback` (or README does not claim a hot update)."
" Change the xacro and restart the hardware / `controller_manager`."
msgstr ""
"在 `on_init` 从 `info_.hardware_parameters` 读取。没有 "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`（或 README 未声明可热更新）。改 xacro 并重启硬件 / "
"`controller_manager`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: 6b702670f22b42d7b03d1789b4019760
msgid "**Runtime**"
msgstr "**运行时**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:37
#: 73fcce58e7f541f4afba570b5666baa1
msgid ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`, or a README + source path that re-reads"
" `ros2 param set` without reload (HighTorque kp/kd poll)."
msgstr ""
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`，或 README + 源码路径表明 `ros2 param set` "
"无需重载即可生效（HighTorque 的 kp/kd 轮询）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/0-index.md:55
#: 3371f842f70f49a68b8dde8d3a55e840
msgid ""
"The in-tree [`hardwares/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/README.md)"
" is **build-only** (`colcon build --packages-up-to …`). Names on the "
"driver pages come from each public README and from `on_init` / plugin XML"
