msgid ""
"Hardware `<param>` values do **not** appear on `ros2 param list` unless "
"that plugin also `declare_parameter`s them. Confirm the plugin and xacro "
"as in [Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"硬件 `<param>` **不会**出现在 `ros2 param list` 上，除非该插件也 `declare_parameter` "
"了同名项。按 [配置 ROS 2 "
"控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md) 核对插件和 xacro。"

